h. Generated clone/view regenerated.","parents":[{"sha":"71a4ce3c9fa12b9cb440392c0e9325c5a20950b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/71a4ce3c9fa12b9cb440392c0e9325c5a20950b5","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/71a4ce3c9fa12b9cb440392c0e9325c5a20950b5"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"22ed1eb6cfc2450818b34499ed814c707e5e1f66","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDIyZWQxZWI2Y2ZjMjQ1MDgxOGIzNDQ5OWVkODE0YzcwN2U1ZTFmNjY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/22ed1eb6cfc2450818b34499ed814c707e5e1f66","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/22ed1eb6cfc2450818b34499ed814c707e5e1f66","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2026-06-10T12:21:08Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2026-06-10T14:55:08Z"},"tree":{"sha":"c141d8632a6e0097dad4d3c9903a27afe437113f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/c141d8632a6e0097dad4d3c9903a27afe437113f"},"message":"state, poll: refcount poll sessions, mark offline only on last release\n\nA cancelled map request whose handler ran late could Connect after the\nlive session, steal the newest SessionEpoch, then exit without\ndisconnecting (stillConnected path); the live session's final\nDisconnect was rejected as stale and the node stayed online forever\n(relogin flake). Counted releases are order-independent, so overlapping\nsessions cannot strand a node in either direction.","parents":[{"sha":"4cd45733838051385208f1ae1c69a17221d4ebae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/4cd45733838051385208f1ae1c69a17221d4ebae","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/4cd45733838051385208f1ae1c69a17221d4ebae"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"e554207e7407cb6206c6e7d5f27af2e91ea1fcf6","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGU1NTQyMDdlNzQwN2NiNjIwNmM2ZTdkNWYyN2FmMmU5MWVhMWZjZjY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/e554207e7407cb6206c6e7d5f27af2e91ea1fcf6","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/e554207e7407cb6206c6e7d5f27af2e91ea1fcf6","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2026-06-10T12:21:16Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2026-06-10T14:55:08Z"},"tree":{"sha":"7c904523eef21e9f2364be060617f70cdbf2a6dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/7c904523eef21e9f2364be060617f70cdbf2a6dd"},"message":"servertest: add logout/relogin storm repro with poll churn\n\nMirrors the flaky integration relogin tests with production batcher\ntuning. The churn variant restarts map polls around login like newer\ntailscaled does; pre-fix it stranded nodes online after logout 2/2.","parents":[{"sha":"22ed1eb6cfc2450818b34499ed814c707e5e1f66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/22ed1eb6cfc2450818b34499ed814c707e5e1f66","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/22ed1eb6cfc2450818b34499ed814c707e5e1f66"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"a1a965401f39f672b62ffd6b2291e3094c3a6318","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGExYTk2NTQwMWYzOWY2NzJiNjJmZmQ2YjIyOTFlMzA5NGMzYTYzMTg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/a1a965401f39f672b62ffd6b2291e3094c3a6318","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/a1a965401f39f672b62ffd6b2291e3094c3a6318","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2026-06-10T13:42:05Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2026-06-10T14:55:08Z"},"tree":{"sha":"6f6047085a0042a22f5652c8705f2a88e0dbe422","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/6f6047085a0042a22f5652c8705f2a88e0dbe422"},"message":"mapper: gate broadcast sends until a connection's initial map is delivered\n\nAddNode registers the connection before sending the initial map, so a\nbatched delta could land first and become the stream's first frame;\nTailscale clients then kill the poll with \"initial MapResponse lacked\nNode\" and a retry loop under steady change traffic leaves the netmap\nempty. Skip connections awaiting their initial map and retry the\nchange next tick — the in-flight map may predate it, so it cannot be\ndropped. Retries are prepended to keep patch order.","parents":[{"sha":"e554207e7407cb6206c6e7d5f27af2e91ea1fcf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/e554207e7407cb6206c6e7d5f27af2e91ea1fcf6","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/e554207e7407cb6206c6e7d5f27af2e91ea1fcf6"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"aa28d843cf2372201a513b79c6fa7db47c716cc7","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGFhMjhkODQzY2YyMzcyMjAxYTUxM2I3OWM2ZmE3ZGI0N2M3MTZjYzc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/aa28d843cf2372201a513b79c6fa7db47c716cc7","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/aa28d843cf2372201a513b79c6fa7db47c716cc7","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2026-06-10T13:42:15Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2026-06-10T14:55:08Z"},"tree":{"sha":"d5e0a1ae1f60bbb4b6657f0f31984228075df633","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/d5e0a1ae1f60bbb4b6657f0f31984228075df633"},"message":"policy: read pm.pol under the mutex\n\nNodeCanHaveTag, TagExists, ViaRoutesForPeer checked pm.pol before\ntaking pm.mu, racing SetPolicy's write (caught by -race in\nTestRaceConcurrentServerMutations). DebugString read pol, filter, and\nthe derived maps with no lock at all.","parents":[{"sha":"a1a965401f39f672b62ffd6b2291e3094c3a6318","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/a1a965401f39f672b62ffd6b2291e3094c3a6318","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/a1a965401f39f672b62ffd6b2291e3094c3a6318"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":26580969614,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz888AAAABFAobXc8AAAAGMFlojg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/26580969614","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"aa28d843cf2372201a513b79c6fa7db47c716cc7","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kradalby/headscale/commits/aa28d843cf2372201a513b79c6fa7db47c716cc7","created_at":"2026-06-10T15:03:06Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"718381038a9706eb676adcf4ec7c80976a3d75f8","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDcxODM4MTAzOGE5NzA2ZWI2NzZhZGNmNGVjN2M4MDk3NmEzZDc1Zjg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/718381038a9706eb676adcf4ec7c80976a3d75f8","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/718381038a9706eb676adcf4ec7c80976a3d75f8","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2026-06-11T09:43:29Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2026-06-11T09:43:29Z"},"tree":{"sha":"eca7a3cb58a12f1b4c64323e9d839753aefdc09f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/eca7a3cb58a12f1b4c64323e9d839753aefdc09f"},"message":"auth: clamp logout expiry to now\n\nTailscale sends the sentinel time.Unix(123, 0) on logout; storing it\nverbatim propagates a 1970 KeyExpiry to every peer's netmap. Same\nsemantics (expired as of now), saner logs and debug dumps.","parents":[{"sha":"aa28d843cf2372201a513b79c6fa7db47c716cc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/aa28d843cf2372201a513b79c6fa7db47c716cc7","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/aa28d843cf2372201a513b79c6fa7db47c716cc7"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"fca5a79c454331ace8b9d61d81c5c75a4bb8db6b","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGZjYTVhNzljNDU0MzMxYWNlOGI5ZDYxZDgxYzVjNzVhNGJiOGRiNmI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/fca5a79c454331ace8b9d61d81c5c75a4bb8db6b","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/fca5a79c454331ace8b9d61d81c5c75a4bb8db6b","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2026-06-11T10:24:18Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2026-06-11T10:24:18Z"},"tree":{"sha":"70fe6c55706989f85a5df19c28ee6a2a5d7bf99d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/70fe6c55706989f85a5df19c28ee6a2a5d7bf99d"},"message":"flake, go.mod: refresh dependencies\n\ntailscale.com v1.100.0 -> v1.101.0-pre, golang.org/x/*